:[1,1,0,0.85],"tariffs":[1,1,0,0.85],"pricing_power":[1,1,0,0.85],"cost_cuts":[1,1,0,0.85],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.1063,"r5":-0.0234,"r20":0.33,"r1_spy":0.1094,"r5_spy":-0.035,"r20_spy":0.2983,"r1_sector":0.1226,"r5_sector":-0.0051,"r20_sector":0.334,"etf":"XLI"}},{"id":"AXON 2026 Q3","t":"AXON","d":"2026-11-05","time":"amc","w":9582,"n":43,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/axon-enterprise-axon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[1,1,0,1.06],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.1818,"r5":-0.1972,"r1_spy":-0.185,"r5_spy":-0.2301,"r1_sector":-0.1831,"r5_sector":-0.2401,"etf":"XLI"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"AXON 2020 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"There were some programs that we had committed to that we’re not going to be able to do in person now and there’s some cost savings that are associated with that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2020-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"We are withdrawing our guidance today for one reason, the full extent and impact of the current crisis on the markets we serve and on our business simply cannot be known at this time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2020-08-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"…talked about when we last spoke about when you think about something like dispatch and you think about something like Axon Aware and building geo relocation and live streaming into our cameras really being part of a bigger mission for agencies around real-time operations and broadening that lens.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2020-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"Recall that last year we diversified our supply chain and global manufacturing footprint due to tariffs and it turns out that those initiatives positioned us well to handle COVID-19; even so given the number of unforeseen challenges that could lay ahead and the fact that 2020 is full of…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2020-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"So as we looked at really our kind of next 6 to 12 months based on our previous experience with really adjusting for tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2020-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"I think we're very, very excited about where we're at right now with interest in live streaming and other connected features with a AB3.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2020-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"And we've seen just tremendous growth in the adoption of live streaming as it begins to roll out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2020-11-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"As you pointed out, it's the same products, but we're really stepping up our game from a marketing standpoint and we've been making a run-in, not only increasing sales with distributors, but especially with direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"As you see in our shareholder letter we're also tracking above plan on the bottom line and that's driven by revenue out-performance expense leverage in travel and event cost savings of about $12 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"Technologies like Axon Respond in our live streaming platform.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2020 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"A municipal security unit in Chile has been trialing Axon Respond live streaming to ensure the quality and security of the supply chain and transportation process for COVID-19 vaccine distribution in their community.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2021-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"Demand for this premium fleet bundle, which includes ALPR software add-on and the live streaming off of our cameras is exceeding our expectations by a healthy margin, and you can read more about this in detail in our shareholder letter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2021-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"We are also seeing growing adoption in the usage of LTE-enabled live streaming off of the body cameras and remote evidence uploads.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"So far this year, TASER device manufacturing and supply chain improvements are on track to deliver more than $4 million in gross cost savings in 2021.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2021-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"We're seeing markets, but we do not necessarily think about our plan is, it's kind of our first candidates to deploy streaming technology.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2021-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"I'd like to call you one customer in the UK just signed our largest international Respond-Plus deal to date, which is our live streaming package.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"As you saw in our shareholder letter; today, we are raising our outlook for both fiscal year's 2021 and 2022, which reflects our confidence in our growing global demand.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2021-11-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"We're seeing improving the attach rates on our premium services like Respond, which is the live streaming of body cameras.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2021-11-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"We do think there's an opportunity for us to increase direct-to-consumer with some of the products we're developing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2022-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mita Marshall","x":"And then, maybe second, it sounded like you guys were able to kind of work around and find alternatives for a lot of the products, but just getting a sense of, if you think there’s any price increases that will need to be passed on to customers?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2022-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jawad Ahsan","x":"We’ll need new facilities with new capabilities, both in terms of automation and streamline manufacturing, as well as showcase spaces for our technology, where we can collaborate with and gather feedback from our increasingly diverse customer and partner base.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2022-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"I want to add on hear that one thing we are working on, that’s why we laid it out for you in our cash estimates is our investment in automation, streamlining, manufacturing, labor reduction, right, that’s a big investment we’re making from a CapEx standpoint to help attack this from the cost side.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2021 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2022-02-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Josh Reilly","x":"And then if you look at the increasing guidance and adjust for the $15 million of AB3 revenue that’s pushed to 2022.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2022-05-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luke Larson","x":"So one of the fastest-growing products we have is Respond, which is our live streaming and other connected camera features on top of the body camera.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2022-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"And we see, obviously, for us to raise guidance in this environment, took a fair amount of confidence for us to look across the business and have the confidence to come forth and share an increasing outlook when most of the world is pulling back.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2022-08-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"And I'd say on top of that, our execution in our Tier 1 markets, the UK, Canada and Australia has been really strong, where we continue to see more adoption of Evidence.com and body cams, but also kind of our newer features on Evidence.com like real-time streaming and transcription.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2022-08-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"They're seeing use cases for live streaming.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2022-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Ho","x":"And then just as a follow-up, when we think about some of the cost savings initiatives that you referenced, either on the T&E side or other areas.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2022-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Ho","x":"Can you talk a little bit about the level of benefit or cost savings that you could maybe see from that deal?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2022-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"And in terms of free cash flow, I'd just say, we've reiterated our guidance, because we feel like, frankly, coming from sales, this to me is not all that different than inside sales.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2022-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sami Badri","x":"…growth target I was hoping you could kind of give us an idea on how you're going to get there, either by new subscriptions, existing subscriptions that are seeing some price increases as a function of new features -- maybe you could kind of give us an idea on the composition of that 20% growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2022-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Erik Lapinski","x":"And do you see opportunity to potentially streamline that or build software around it over time that makes it kind of more simplified, I guess, in moving fully to records and just to understand maybe some of the time lines you're seeing with those 12.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2022-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"We are raising our outlook from $200 million to a range of $215 million to $220 million, which we believe demonstrates strong performance on profitability.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2022 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2023-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"Almost $5 billion is still large opportunity that we're interested in pursuing, but we are rightsizing our focus to better reflect the normal opportunity we see in our core business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2023-05-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeff Kunins","x":"…it is, encouraging the and asking them to jump in on that right now as opposed to today’s live streaming, which requires someone to be deciding to be passively watching and deciding to go in or with signal alerts like that might come in from time to time. So there is a lot of excitement about…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2023-05-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Patrick Smith","x":"Live streaming when we introduced it a few years ago was a totally new concept.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2023-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Smith","x":"And with VR, we’re going to be able to dramatically streamline the training of officers by creating virtual training spaces, where a lot of it could happen without direct even human oversight from an instructor as they are learning the base its skills.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2023-08-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Kunins","x":"And then full circle back to Respond and really moving live streaming in this future of modern multimodal communications from a thing that feels like an add-on to a thing that feels central and native to the product itself.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2023-08-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Kunins","x":"And number two, this idea of the watch me button, you've heard us say it but from a psychology standpoint, one of the things that has been an opportunity for agencies to think about how they'll adopt live streaming is simply who is starting it.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2023-08-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Patrick Smith","x":"An investment in Axon is investing in the future of AI and it has been for several years.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joshua Isner","x":"This drove our confidence in increasing our guidance which Brittany will take you through in a moment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William Power","x":"You raised guidance pretty significantly for the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2023-11-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"The promotional video showing how you use live streaming cameras, counter drone, you know, TASER 10, all in an integrated way.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2023-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"We are pleased to increase our outlook again.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2024-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"And then, the one aid of that, I'd say, is our response product, which is our live streaming product.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2023 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2024-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"And there, that's all the live streaming from the body camera that's where Fusus slots in as well.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2024-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"And when you think about the complexity of deploying AI at scale and the massive GPU clusters you're going to need and the connectivity into the cloud just eases all that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2024-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"We believe we are uniquely positioned to leverage our position as the application and network layer to create significant value through time and cost savings that we deliver from the underlying technology through a world-class UI to our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q2","e":"axon","d":"2024-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"Turning to our outlook, we are pleased to raise guidance again on both revenue and adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2024-11-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"But I think that, so our customers are seeing again things that just feel almost magical, that are possible with AI and our investment in things like our EAC, our ethics Advisory Council to help us do safety testing on things like Draft One.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2024-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jordan Lyonnais","x":"On the administration change, how are you guys looking at the opportunities versus the risks involved, just with what plans have been said, if they come true or not, the increased emphasis on border security versus tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2024-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jordan Lyonnais","x":"And then on just if tariffs are imposed, how are you looking at what levers you can pull to offset any supply chain component changes?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2024-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"George Notter","x":"One last follow up and I'll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2024-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"Now turning to our guidance, we are pleased to raise guidance again on both revenue and adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2025-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"And as Rick mentioned, we believe our investments around AI, real-time operations, and drones and robotics roughly doubles our overall opportunity set.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2025-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Keith Housum","x":"But obviously tariffs are top of mind for a lot of people these days, both on a cost perspective for the companies as well as perhaps demand issues for geopolitical issues.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2025-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Keith Housum","x":"How are you guys thinking about tariffs from both aspects?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2025-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"One final note before I pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2024 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2025-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"So with that, I'll pass it on to a guy again who I'm just excited to work with, who really leads the business, which gives me the time to spend a lot of time with our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"The fleet camera is already a real-time camera in-car that does ALPR and live streaming video.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"…the last few years with some of the federal agencies to make body cameras, evidence.com and live streaming available to them as kind of the precursor to fill in some of the existing blanks around better video in more places, better counter drone solutions, and of course, more drone solutions…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"Finally, I'll conclude with a quick note about the current tariff situation, which Brittany can expand upon in more detail.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Josh Isner","x":"A couple of years ago, our team flagged tariffs and the uncertainty in the South China Sea as reasons to diversify our supply chain and make large but low-risk investments in inventory.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"We are not planning any price increases to our customers at this point.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"Our comfort in raising guidance is based on the strong Q1 bookings performance, as well as the pipeline we see for the year and the future contracted bookings of $9.9 billion.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2025-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"On adjusted EBITDA, we continue to target margin of approximately 25% for the year, which raises our guidance to $650 million to $675 million from our previous outlook of $640 million to $670 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joseph Cardoso","x":"And maybe specifically curious if adoption is being more done in isolation, meaning you are just seeing folks go out and basically purchase the AI Era Plan, or if you are seeing customers expand spend in other areas of the portfolio at the same time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/axon-axon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2026-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"Adjusted gross margin came in at 61.1%, down sequentially due to the impact of tariffs and increased mix from solutions, partially offset by continued strong growth in high-margin software and services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/axon-axon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2026-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"This expectation includes the impact from our increased investment in several product and market areas, as well as impacts from global tariffs, inflationary component costs including memory, and acquisitions that are still scaling.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/axon-axon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2026-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"When Josh talks about where we were five years ago, with a much lower peak price point—it was, I think, in the $200 range—we have not just raised prices to get there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/axon-axon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"As AI increasingly commoditizes software development, the companies with defensible positions are those that own the full stack, including hardware.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/axon-axon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2025 Q4","e":"axon","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"I think this whole “SaaSpocalypse” has got some real risk to it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/axon-axon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2026 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2026-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joshua M. Isner","x":"One is for plate reads, and the other is for CCTV streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/axon-axon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2026 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joshua M. Isner","x":"And finally, it is no secret that physical AI infrastructure is going to be a source of record spending in the years to come.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/axon-axon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2026 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"Incorporated in this guidance is continued tariffs, inflationary component costs inclusive of memory, and product mix shift from continued platform solutions growth as well as software.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/axon-axon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2026 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brittany Bagley","x":"I would say we are really careful on pricing to make sure that we are delivering more value to our customers before we take prices up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/axon-axon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2026 Q1","e":"axon","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick Smith","x":"Draft One, Form One, Brief One are streamlining records.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/axon-axon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AXON 2026 Q3","e":"axon","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joshua Isner","x":"And like I said, as the risk hopefully dies down over the next 12 to 18 months, we'll rightsize that back down accor